# Generated test / security reports — keep only the push recipe tracked
# (README + generate-reports.sh). All suite outputs stay local.
tests/TestReport/**
!tests/TestReport/README.md
!tests/TestReport/generate-reports.sh

# Belt-and-suspenders: never commit bulky / generated summary artifacts
